          "text": "trait Step {\n  fn step!(self: &mut Self) -> Unit\n}\n\nstruct Counter {\n  field mut n: i64\n}\n\nimpl Step for Counter {\n  fn step!(self: &mut Self) -> Unit {\n    self.n = wrapping_add(self.n, 1)\n  }\n}\n\nfn step_once![T: Step](value: &mut T) -> Unit {\n  value.step!()\n}\n\nfn run() -> i64 {\n  let mut counter = Counter{ n: 0 }\n  step_once!::[Counter](&mut counter)\n  yield counter.n\n}\n\nfn main!() -> Res[Str, Str] {\n  yield Ok(to_str(run()))\n}\n"
        }
      }
